STATEMENT: >>>
The user-authorized scheduled workflow shall start a hidden five-hour-budget campaign at local midnight and review its actual artifacts at 05:05 America/Los_Angeles. Startup and results review shall distinguish active, missing, failed, unfinished and budget-exhausted work; a configured schedule shall not be treated as an executed five-hour qualification run.
<<<
