STATEMENT: >>>
Qualification shall exercise CSC unions whose empty column is followed by a lower row in the next column, compare seeded small canonical unions against an independent set oracle, and bound the probe in an owned subprocess that is reaped on every exit path. A liveness regression shall produce a test failure before the outer mutation timeout. Exact mutation selection shall reject traversal in its filename prefix while accepting legitimate Rust rest-pattern syntax in its description; actual native inventory equality shall remain mandatory before mutation execution.
