Implementation: src/configured.rs retains the initialization Newton report. Verification: tests/overnight_survivors.rs independently counts provider calls for implicit and explicit initial states. The original implementation reported one initialization solve when the independent provider observed six; the new regression failed before correction. This is accounting evidence, not a numerical-conformance claim.
<<<
